{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15081","headline":"良田无晚岁 · 张佐","name":"良田无晚岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人功虽未及，地力信非常。\n不任耕耘早，偏宜黍稷良。\n无年皆有获，後种亦先芳。\n膴膴盈千亩，青青保万箱。\n何须祭田祖，讵要察农祥。\n况是春三月，和风日又长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}